SeND changes: forward keyDerivationAlgorithm to the worker key options; select
HKDF or PBKDF2 consistently for key import, derivation and ratcheting; accept
the 256-entry MatrixRTC key ring. PBKDF2 remains the upstream default.

Only the worker is copied here. The client SDK remains a pinned pub dependency.
Rebuild this worker for every web release, and review these changes when
updating livekit_client. Never modify the developer's global pub cache.
